docs/catalog-sources/group3-hoist-arsenal-prime-atlantis-rogue-impulse-legend-sorinex-titan.md:268:PRIME does not publish SKU codes on its storefront — products are named `LINE | Movement`. That naming is itself the model identity, so record it verbatim including the line prefix. SmartStrength® is PRIME's adjustable resistance-curve technology and appears across the Plate Loaded, Selectorized, Hybrid and Evolution ranges; it is a technology, not a product line.
docs/catalog-sources/group3-hoist-arsenal-prime-atlantis-rogue-impulse-legend-sorinex-titan.md:706:Notes: Effectively unresearched — budget ran out. Titan names products descriptively and does not surface model codes on its storefront (an eBay listing showed "LEGPRS1" but I could not corroborate it on titan.fitness, so it is excluded). Titan's T-3 / T-2 / X-3 rack families are widely referenced but I did not load a Titan rack page in this session, so I am not listing them. Titan should be re-researched before shipping.
