    53	/// One exercise as history knows it: the snapshot ID that decides identity
    54	/// and the snapshot name that gets displayed (D23). Two different exercises
    55	/// that happen to share a display name are still two exercises.
    56	struct HistoryExercise: Equatable {
    57	    var id: UUID
