codex
Two concrete integrity failures are confirmed so far: model/exercise-wide “previous performance” selects snapshots without the preset filter, and JSON omits the preset catalog plus machine defaults. Records math itself keeps `nil` and named presets separate, and volume remains preset-agnostic.
