     9	      unaffected; JSON entries gain the same two fields and `schemaVersion` moves to **2**.
    10	- [x] Draft entries export their live preset, frozen entries their snapshot — same rule as the
    11	      rest of the entry context.
    12	- [x] D36–D38 recorded; SPEC's taxonomy, history and export sections updated; STATE refreshed.
