    15	      the part that silently corrupts history when it is wrong.
    16	
    17	## Resolution (2026-08-12)
    18	
    19	Suite: **315 unit + 13 UI tests**. The UI test drives the whole loop — define two presets on a
    20	seeded exercise, make one a machine's usual, log a set, switch grips mid-workout and get a second
    21	entry rather than a relabelled one, then read the variation back out of history.

